                                "sense_id": "6f5401ba-b18c-3ca3-8c2b-8248b740af87",
                                "text": "Mortal lives are not stones. They are not seas. For impermanence to judge itself by the standards of permanence is folly. Or it is arrogance. Life merely is what it is, neither more nor less. To deem it less because it is not more is to heed the counsels of the Despiser."
